%% 嘎教练 P0 增量 — S2 首屏渲染 → 写 seen_at → 取消推送（W5 / W11）
%% 来源：docs/design/COACH-P0-ARCH.md §1.3

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Page as DashboardPage / AiChatPage
  participant Bubble as CoachWeeklyBubble / CoachWeeklyCard
  participant Pro as coachUnreadWeeklyProvider
  participant Notifier as CoachWeeklyNotifier
  participant Repo as CoachProactiveRepository
  participant Push as CoachPushSink

  Page->>Pro: watch()
  Pro->>Repo: getWeekly(mondayOf(now))
  Repo-->>Pro: record?
  Pro-->>Page: record（null → 气泡整块不渲染）

  Page->>Bubble: 渲染正文
  Bubble->>Notifier: initState → markSeen(id)  %% 绝不在 build 里写库
  Notifier->>Repo: markSeen(id)  %% UPDATE ... WHERE seen_at IS NULL（幂等）
  Notifier->>Push: cancel(200)
  Notifier->>Pro: invalidate()
  Pro-->>Page: null → 气泡消失（教练页卡片改读 coachLatestWeeklyProvider，仍显示）
